🔒 Why NetSuite Does NOT Allow Override
NetSuite enforces this to:

Prevent returning inventory that was never received
Maintain audit trails
Protect stock valuation
Avoid financial inconsistencies

Because of this:

Status is system‑controlled
Scripts, workflows, and client scripts cannot change it

This is Working As Designed.
